r 02\">02</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: demanding chase\">Demanding chase</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Required rate ≥16 runs per over</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-4\" data-name=\"definition 03 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"definition number 03\">03</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: wicket pressure\">Wicket pressure</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Five or more wickets lost</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-5\" data-name=\"definition 04 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"definition number 04\">04</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: semi-final / final\">Semi-final / final</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Also includes qualifiers and eliminators</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"def-col\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"batter-specific column\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-1\" data-name=\"column heading: batter-specific\">Batter-specific</h3>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-2\" data-name=\"definition 05 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"definition number 05\">05</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: first-innings recovery\">First-innings recovery</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">First half · 2+ wickets lost · batting side</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-3\" data-name=\"definition 06 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"definition number 06\">06</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: powerplay collapse\">Powerplay collapse</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Overs 1–6 · 2+ wickets lost · batting side</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-4\" data-name=\"definition 07 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"definition number 07\">07</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: middle-order response\">Middle-order response</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Batting positions 4–6 in pressure or after 2+ wickets</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-5\" data-name=\"definition 08 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"definition number 08\">08</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: opener consistency\">Opener consistency</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">30+ runs · SR 160+ · 50%+ runs from boundaries</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-6\" data-name=\"definition 09 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"definition number 09\">09</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-6-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: middle-order spin handling\">Middle-order spin handling</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Strike rate and runs above context vs spin</p></div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"def-col\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3\" data-name=\"bowler-specific column\">\n<h3 data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-1\" data-name=\"column heading: bowler-specific\">Bowler-specific</h3>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-2\" data-name=\"definition 10 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"definition number 10\">10</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: powerplay partnership break\">Powerplay partnership break</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Overs 1–6 · stand 30+ · striker 20+ from 12+ balls</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-3\" data-name=\"definition 11 row\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"definition number 11\">11</span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"definition content\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"definition title: death-over settled-batter pressure\">Death-over settled-batter pressure</b><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"definition description\">Last five overs · 6+ wickets in hand · stand 30+ · striker 20+ from 12+ balls</p></div></div>\n<div class=\"def\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-4\" data-name=\"definitions closing note row\" style=\"border-top:0\"><span class=\"def-num\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"closing note number placeholder\"></span><div data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"closing note content\"><p data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"closing note text\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Each delivery can qualify through one or more signals.</p></div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"footer\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6\" data-name=\"footer disclaimer bar\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"footer brand and scope\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand name\">PRESSURE/PLAY</b> · Context-adjusted rankings · 2022 onward</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2\" data-name=\"footer methodology and data counts\">883 matches · 2,00,999 deliveries · HistGradientBoosting, match-grouped validation</span>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-11-18T01:12:16.756299+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-11-18T01:14:43.811829+00:00",
      "id": "var_6433ddf52ea1",
      "contentHeight": 1976
    },
    "var_b66b4d9e8985": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "Pressure rankings — table-first workspace",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 1540,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 0
      },
      "html": "<style>\n@import url(\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/lucide-static@1.48.0/font/lucide.css\");\n\n:root{\n  --ink:#32222b; --body:#6f5464; --muted:#8d8188; --line:#ecdbe2;\n  --paper:#fff0f5; --card:#fff; --brand:#E40C93;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\nh1,h2,h3,p{margin:0}\nbutton{font:inherit;color:inherit}\ntd,th,.stat b,.leader-score b,.expand-value,.score-badge{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n.app{display:flex;min-height:100vh;background:var(--paper)}\n\n/* rail */\n.rail{width:72px;min-width:72px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:16px 0 18px;background:#fce7ee;border-right:1px solid #f0d3de}\n.rail-mark{width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#d3007f;margin-bottom:14px}\n.rail-mark svg{width:100%;height:100%}\n.rail-btn{width:44px;height:44px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:transparent;color:#9a6d82;font-size:19px;cursor:pointer}\n.rail-btn.on{background:#f7cfdd;color:#3f2834}\n.rail-spacer{flex:1;min-height:40px}\n.rail-avatar{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#f7dde7;color:#6b4b5a;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}\n\n/* main */\n.main{flex:1;min-width:0}\n.topbar{height:65px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff9fb}\n.crumbs{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13px;color:#96818a}\n.crumbs b{color:#5c3f4c}\n.scope{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;font-size:13px;color:#6f5464}\n.scope span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:7px}\n.led{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#d85a94;display:inline-block}\n.icon-btn{width:36px;height:36px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:#7d5a6b;font-size:16px;cursor:pointer}\n.top-avatar{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#f7dde7;color:#6b4b5a;font-size:12px;font-weight:800}\n.inner{max-width:1368px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 40px 30px}\n\n/* heading */\n.page-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;margin-bottom:22px}\nh1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-.032em;font-weight:650;color:#33232c}\n.coverage{display:flex;gap:32px;text-align:right}\n.coverage span{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a08c95}\n.coverage b{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:15px;font-weight:700;color:#5c3f4c;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n\n/* stat row */\n.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid #eddde4;border-bottom:1px solid #eddde4;margin-bottom:20px}\n.stat{padding:14px 0 16px}\n.stat + .stat{padding-left:24px;border-left:1px solid #f2e3ea}\n.stat span{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a08c95}\n.stat b{display:block;margin-top:7px;font-size:30px;line-height:1;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.03em;color:#33232c}\n.stat b small{margin-left:7px;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;color:#8d7883}\n\n/* tabs */\n.tabs{display:flex;gap:28px;border-bottom:1px solid #eddde4;margin-bottom:18px}\n.tab{position:relative;border:0;background:transparent;padding:0 2px 12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#96818a;cursor:pointer}\n.tab.on{color:#33232c;font-weight:700}\n.tab.on::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:-1px;height:2px;background:var(--brand)}\n.tab small{margin-left:6px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#b09aa5}\n\n/* leader band */\n.board{border:1px solid #eee0e6;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;padding:16px 20px 18px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(46,37,43,.035)}\n.board-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:14px}\n.board-title{font-size:18px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#3a2833}\n.seg{display:inline-flex;gap:2px;padding:3px;border:1px solid #ecdbe2;border-radius:9px;background:#fbf4f7}\n.seg button{min-height:30px;padding:0 12px;border:0;border-radius:7px;background:transparent;color:#957f89;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\n.seg button.on{background:#fff;color:#5c3f4c;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(46,37,43,.12)}\n.board-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}\n.leader{padding:0 20px;border-left:1px solid #f3e7ec;background:transparent;border-top:0;border-right:0;border-bottom:0;text-align:left;cursor:pointer}\n.leader:first-child{border-left:0;padding-left:0}\n.leader-rank{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#a4909b}\n.leader-name{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:650;color:#4a323d;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}\n.leader-score{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:5px;margin-top:9px}\n.leader-score b{font-size:26px;font-weight:750;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#5c3f4c}\n.leader-score small{font-size:12px;font-weight:500;color:#a4909b}\n.leader.on .leader-score b{color:var(--brand)}\n.track{display:block;height:5px;margin-top:10px;border-radius:5px;background:#f8e6ed;overflow:hidden}\n.track i{display:block;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;background:#efb9cd}\n.leader.on .track i{background:var(--brand)}\n\n/* table */\n.rankings{border:1px solid #eee0e6;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(46,37,43,.035)}\n.toolbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:16px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #f4e9ee;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.groups{display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.group-btn{min-height:34px;padding:0 13px;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:8px;background:#fbf4f7;color:#8d7883;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.group-btn.on{background:#fbe3ef;border-color:#f2c9da;color:#a31367}\n.all-metrics{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;min-height:34px;padding:0 12px;margin-left:6px;border:1px solid #ecdbe2;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;color:#6f5464;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\n.all-metrics i{font-size:15px}\n.search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-left:auto;width:280px;height:36px;padding:0 11px;border:1px solid #ecdbe2;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:#9c8894;font-size:15px}\n.search input{flex:1;min-width:0;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;font:inherit;font-size:14px;color:#5c4451}\n.search input::placeholder{color:#a4909b}\n.table-scroll{overflow-x:auto}\ntable{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}\nthead{background:#fffafb}\nth{height:54px;padding:0 16px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a08c95;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}\nth:first-child,td:first-child{padding-left:22px}\nth:last-child,td:last-child{padding-right:22px}\ntd{height:44px;padding:0 16px;border-top:1px solid #f2e6ec;font-size:14px;color:#6f5464;white-space:nowrap}\ntr.is-selected{background:#fff4f8}\n.rank-cell{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#a1939a}\n.rank-cell.top{color:#b6718d}\n.player{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;cursor:pointer}\n.initials{width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#f9e7ee;border:1px solid #efdde5;color:#986c80;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;flex:0 0 auto}\n.player b{font-size:14px;font-weight:650;color:#4a323d}\n.emph{color:#a35474;font-weight:700}\n.score-badge{display:inline-grid;place-items:center;min-width:56px;height:27px;border-radius:7px;background:#fbe3ef;color:#bd006e;font-size:13px;font-weight:800}\n\n/* expanded row */\ntr.expand td{padding:0;background:#fffafc;border-top:0}\n.expand-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr)) 240px;gap:0 24px;padding:18px 22px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid #f2e6ec}\n.expand-cell{border-left:1px solid #f2e3ea;padding-left:16px}\n.expand-cell:first-child{border-left:0;padding-left:0}\n.expand-label{display:block;font-size:11px;color:#a08c95}\n.expand-value{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#4a323d}\n.expand-value small{margin-left:5px;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0;color:#a4909b}\n.expand-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;gap:8px}\n.role-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;align-self:flex-start;gap:6px;padding:4px 9px;border:1px solid #f0dde6;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.07em;color:#a3708a}\n.expand-note{font-size:12px;color:#96818a}\n.close-detail{align-self:flex-start;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;border:0;background:transparent;padding:0;color:#a3708a;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer}\n.close-detail i{font-size:13px}\n\n.table-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:14px 22px;border-top:1px solid #f2e6ec;font-size:13px;color:#8d8188}\n.pager{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}\n.pager button{width:30px;height:30px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #ecdbe2;border-radius:7px;background:#fff;color:#7d5a6b;font-size:14px;cursor:pointer}\n.pager .dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#e0cad5}\n\n.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:16px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#96818a}\n.footer b{color:#7d5a6b;font-weight:700}\n</style>\n<div class=\"app\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"app layout container\">\n<aside aria-label=\"Workspace navigation\" class=\"rail\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"workspace navigation rail\">\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"rail-mark\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo mark container\">\n<svg da