s=\"score-badge\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-10-8-1\" data-name=\"pressure score badge\">67.8</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11\" data-name=\"player row (Marcus Stoinis)\">\n<td class=\"rank-cell\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-1\" data-name=\"rank cell value\">10</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-2\" data-name=\"player cell\"><span class=\"player\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-2-1\" data-name=\"player name link\"><span class=\"initials\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-2-1-1\" data-name=\"player initials avatar\">MS</span><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-2-1-2\" data-name=\"player name text\">Marcus Stoinis</b></span></td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-3\" data-name=\"pressure balls value cell\">1,078</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-4\" data-name=\"pressure SR value cell\"><span class=\"emph\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-4-1\" data-name=\"highlighted pressure SR value\">154.9</span></td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-5\" data-name=\"batting average value cell\">30.4</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-6\" data-name=\"boundary share value cell\">66.6%</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-7\" data-name=\"innings at SR150 value cell\">46.9%</td>\n<td data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-8\" data-name=\"score cell\" style=\"text-align:right\"><span class=\"score-badge\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-2-1-2-11-8-1\" data-name=\"pressure score badge\">66.3</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-foot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3\" data-name=\"table footer\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"table result count summary\">Top 10 of 888 batters · search covers all records</span>\n<span class=\"pager\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"table pagination controls\"><button aria-label=\"Previous page\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3-2-1\" data-name=\"previous page button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron left icon\"></i></button><span class=\"dot\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3-2-2\" data-name=\"pagination separator dot\"></span><button aria-label=\"Next page\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3-2-3\" data-name=\"next page button\" type=\"button\"><i class=\"icon-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-5-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\"></i></button></span>\n</div>\n</section>\n<footer class=\"footer\" data-kid=\"1-2-2-6\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"dataset provenance summary\"><b data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"dataset brand label\">PRESSURE/PLAY</b> · 883 matches · 2,00,999 deliveries · 2022 onward</span>\n<span data-kid=\"1-2-2-6-2\" data-name=\"model and validation note\">HistGradientBoosting · match-grouped validation</span>\n</footer>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n",
